<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV/RIGHTS/BONUS.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV/RIGHTS/BONUS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of Volos Technical will trade ex-dividend on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	    DIVIDEND/SHARE    ADJUSTED STARTING PRICE</p>
<p>    Volos Technical	100		     1,367</p>
<p>Also on Friday, common and preferred shares of Michaniki</p>
<p>will trade ex-bonus.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	    ADJUSTED PRICE	  BONUS TERMS</p>
<p>    Michaniki (c)	  1,792		   2-for-10</p>
<p>    Michaniki (p)	  1,483		   2-for-10</p>
<p>The following stocks will trade ex-rights on Friday.</p>
<p>    COMPANY	   ADJUSTED PRICE   RIGHTS TERMS  ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p>    Volos Technical     1,367	    1-for-2	  1,100</p>
<p>    Lavipharm  2,436	    4-for-10	 1,900</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
